<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Versino</book>
  <para style="h">3 Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya datu yeyiyandikwi na Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc3">3 Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya datu yeyiyandikwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohani</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ya 3 Yohani yayandikwi na mtumi Yohani mulukumbi lwa mwaka wa 90 Yesu Kilisitu peamali kuvelekewa. Yohani ajimanyisi lepi ngati mwene ndi myandika, nambu pahali paki akujikemela mgogo 3 Yohani (musula ya 1:1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mewa ikita genago mubalua ya 2 Yohani (musula ya 1:1). Yisadikika kuvya Yohani ayandiki Linenu la Bwina ngati cheliyandikwi na Yohani na balua zidatu ndi 1 Yohani na 2 Yohani na 3 Yohani lukumbi peatamili pamuji wa ku Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohani ayandiki balua yeniyi Gayo mundu mweamsadiki Yesu. Akumluwula Gayo ngati nkozi na kumjovela igana avya mundu mweipokela valongo vevakumsadika Yesu vevavi mulugendu vevipita njila yeniyo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani anaitambulisha balua yaki (musula ya 1:1).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi akumkangamalisa mtima Gayo akamulagiza avya na mtima wa kuvapokela valongo vevakumsadika Yesu (musula ya 1:2-8).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi, akuvalongelela vandu vangi vavili, Diotlefe na Demetilio (musula ya 1:9-12).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi imalakisila balua kujova (musula ya 1:13-14).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Nene gogo chilongosi, nikuyandikila veve Gayo nkozi wangu, mwanikuganili chakaka.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Nkozi wangu, nikuyupila kwa Chapanga mambu gaku gahamba bwina, uvya na makakala muhiga yaku ngati chauvi mumtima waku. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Niheka neju ndava valongo vevahumili kwenuko na kubwela apa, ndi vanijovili cheusadikika uchakaka na uyendelela kutama kwa kuulanda uchakaka magono goha. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Kawaka chindu chechikunisangalusa neju kuliku kuyuwana vana vangu viyendelela kutama kwa kuulanda uchakaka.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gayo cheisadikiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Nkozi wangu, veve ndi usadikiwa neju muchochoha chaukuvakila valongo vaku vevakumsadika Yesu hati ngati vayehe. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Valongo avo vavajovili msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu kuuvala uganu waku. Uyendelela kuvatangatila na vayendelela na lugendu lwavi mukumganisa Chapanga. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />Muni vitumbula lugendu lwavi muutendekela wa Kilisitu na vaganili lepi kupokela utangatila wowoha kuhuma kwa vandu vangamsadika Kilisitu. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Hinu, tete tiganikiwa kuvatangatila vandu ava, muni na tete tipata kuvya pamonga nawu mulihengu lavi kukokosa uchakaka.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diotilefe na Dimetilio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Nayandiki balua yihupi kwa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu, nambu Diotilefe, mweigana neju kuvya chilongosi wavi, aganili lepi kuniyuwanila. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Penibwela yati nifiyula mambu goha geikita, mambu goha gahakau geakitili na malovi goha gahakau geijova ndava yitu udesi waki. Mwene ibela kuvakalibisa valongo avo vevavi mulugendu, na kuvabesa vandu vangi vevigana kuvakalibisha, na kulinga kuvavinga kuvala ya msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Nkozi wangu, kotoka kulanda mambu gahakau nambu landa gegavi gabwina. Mundu yoyoha mweikita mambu gabwina mwenuyo wa Chapanga na mundu yoyoha mweikita gahakau mwenuyo wa angammanya Chapanga.<verse eid="3JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Kila mundu akumlumba Demetilio, na uchakaka wene wijova naha. Mewawa na tete tavete tikumlongalela bwina, na veve umanyili uchaka uyidakilana.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jambusa ya kumalakisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Nivii nagu gamahele gakukujovela, nambu mbwitu kukuyandikila mubalua. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Nihuvalila kukulola papipi na penapo yati tilongela mihu kwa mihu.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Nikuganila uteke. Vankozi vaku vakujambusa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:15">Vajambusayi vankozi vitu voha kila mmonga mwene.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>